{"4666090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midnight Moments", "steam_appid": 4666090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Moments is a small cyberpunk diorama-building game where you create cozy rain-soaked backstreets, a single building, or an entire neighborhood corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/b0d5b53b8bf5d973a5763b997d710e71.poster.avif?t=1786339914\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/b0d5b53b8bf5d973a5763b997d710e71.webm?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/b0d5b53b8bf5d973a5763b997d710e71.mp4?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack buildings, thread alleyways between them, dress rooftops with antennae and garden plots, hang neon signs from facades still soaked from rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/3db4ef6afd2d7e8d16d43501f5368d03.poster.avif?t=1786339914\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/3db4ef6afd2d7e8d16d43501f5368d03.webm?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/3db4ef6afd2d7e8d16d43501f5368d03.mp4?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in and start filling the world. Arrange props and citizens until it looks exactly the way you imagined it. Watch rain streak down neon-lit facades as light pools beneath street lamps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/6407e2417e78f1390b66e3786e018a80.poster.avif?t=1786339914\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/6407e2417e78f1390b66e3786e018a80.webm?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/6407e2417e78f1390b66e3786e018a80.mp4?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create your world, step back, and just stare at it for a while, relaxing into the vibes of your district. No objectives, no timers, no pressure. The kind of game you come back to when you need to unwind.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Moments is a small cyberpunk diorama-building game where you create cozy rain-soaked backstreets, a single building, or an entire neighborhood corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/b0d5b53b8bf5d973a5763b997d710e71.poster.avif?t=1786339914\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/b0d5b53b8bf5d973a5763b997d710e71.webm?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/b0d5b53b8bf5d973a5763b997d710e71.mp4?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack buildings, thread alleyways between them, dress rooftops with antennae and garden plots, hang neon signs from facades still soaked from rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/3db4ef6afd2d7e8d16d43501f5368d03.poster.avif?t=1786339914\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/3db4ef6afd2d7e8d16d43501f5368d03.webm?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/3db4ef6afd2d7e8d16d43501f5368d03.mp4?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in and start filling the world. Arrange props and citizens until it looks exactly the way you imagined it. Watch rain streak down neon-lit facades as light pools beneath street lamps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/6407e2417e78f1390b66e3786e018a80.poster.avif?t=1786339914\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/6407e2417e78f1390b66e3786e018a80.webm?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/extras/6407e2417e78f1390b66e3786e018a80.mp4?t=1786339914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create your world, step back, and just stare at it for a while, relaxing into the vibes of your district. No objectives, no timers, no pressure. The kind of game you come back to when you need to unwind.</p>", "short_description": "A small, cyberpunk diorama-building game where you create cozy rain-soaked backstreets, glowing apartment blocks, or quiet neighbourhood corners. Decorate your designs with props and place citizens, crafting stories that bring your city to life. At your own pace. No goals. Just vibes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/3acb317d02747261895e374516b2a66282d32f56/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1786339914", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/715ca6a4733f41a66f40a18773496d639ca18937/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1786339914", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666090/715ca6a4733f41a66f40a18773496d639ca18937/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1786339914", "website": "https://www.midnightmoments.io", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© Copyright 2026 Happy Volcano BV.<br />\r\n", "developers": ["Happy Volcano"], "publishers": ["Happy Volcano"], "d